  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"472\" height=\"156\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&logo=condaforge&logoColor=d9aa6b&labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-Upgraded Core-F16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=FFFFFF&labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"239\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.16.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.17.x-Unsupported-red?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.x-Active Development-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">请使用 CurseForge 下载，请勿重新托管文件。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组可用于任何整合包。（仅限 CurseForge）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">目前暂无 Fabric 版本计划，抱歉。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">致一直询问 Paxel（镐斧铲三合一工具）的玩家 ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">升级工具</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">提供替代材质包 ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/upgraded-netherite-alternative\" rel=\"nofollow\">升级下界合金：替代版</a></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;（已更新！）</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>模组说明</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">添加 Creativerite（创意金属）护甲、马铠、武器和工具。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>/!\\ </strong><span style=\"color:#000\">本</span><span style=\"color:#000\">模组不包含合成表。你需要自行通过数据包或类似 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a> 的模组添加合成。 </span><strong>/!\\</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">效果</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><strong>Creativerite（创意金属）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>武器与盾牌</strong></em>：一击必杀。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>工具</strong></em>：瞬间破坏。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>马铠</strong></em>：无伤害、免疫负面效果、持续治疗。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲</strong></em>：飞行、无伤害、免疫负面效果、饱和度恢复、持续治疗。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">支持配置无碰撞飞行。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的其他模组</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 及以上</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jTc5hni.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">旧版</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VV3KsKX.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EHr3tPZ.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>",
